And the af-hobat tzipur, sheen kabua ala hen zeman.

cue0020663
01:16:15.768 --> 01:16:18.368
This is a hobat tzipur that doesn't have a fixed date.

cue0020664
01:16:18.368 --> 01:16:21.808
For instance, Kegon Pare Al-Intabar, Shasabur.

cue0020665
