The sabur made of Adon, which is Hayat Fatah, and this was, the sabur was made because of Ra'at Bedin Tatahu.

cue0020666
01:16:30.608 --> 01:16:34.928
Then, you have to bring a Qorban, or Se'il Al-Abad Zaran.

cue0020667
01:16:34.928 --> 01:16:42.128
You made a, the sabur was told, that is permitted to make such a kind of Abad Zaran, and they made it,

cue0020668
