Then they have to bring Se'ir. So this is also support. And therefore, apparently you could bring it to Barakita now.

cue0020669
01:16:53.128 --> 01:16:56.128
It's just like in Pesaḥim. It means that this.

cue0020670
01:16:56.128 --> 01:17:00.128
T'kol chobot hakabu alayhim zeman ki Pesaḥim.

cue0020671
01:17:00.128 --> 01:17:07.128
In other words, Pesaḥim is a kind of a key symbol.

cue0020672
01:17:07.128 --> 01:17:14.328
And that is a key symbol, what is the property, I mean, the peculiarities of Tisachim.

cue0020673
01:17:14.328 --> 01:17:20.328
Tisakavu alayhim zeman. So therefore from here you learn that anything which is Tisakavu alayhim zeman,

cue0020674
