you cannot bring it in Barak etanah Now why does it say therefore out of all those Tisakavu alayhim zeman Tisakim maybe because of what I said before that although it has a sub it has an aspect to it which is Qorban Yahid nonetheless although it Qorban Yahid since it has qabwa al eno karebe tbama kitana

cue0020675
01:17:45.982 --> 01:17:53.422
Alright, so, Manni, who is, according to whose theory, goes the smish?

cue0020676
01:17:53.422 --> 01:17:58.222
Now, the Bishmon on him, the Daniyar, the Bishmon omer,

cue0020677
01:17:58.222 --> 01:18:06.782
after the bull, regarding the statue, what happened before Binyam Bet HaMigdash?

cue0020678
