Afsabur lo hekrivu el ha-Pesaḥim, v'chobot shekavu alehen zeman.

cue0020680
01:18:19.362 --> 01:18:24.962
In Bama Gedolah, Ravishimon, Ravishimon,

cue0020681
01:18:24.962 --> 01:18:28.202
Yamaru, V'chad Esvachim, Adinot Zerachim,

cue0020682
01:18:28.202 --> 01:18:31.962
Afsabur lo hekrivu el ma Gedolah, Shom Chobah,

cue0020683
01:18:31.962 --> 01:18:36.202
El ha-Pesaḥim, v'chobot ha-kevu alehen zeman.

cue0020684
01:18:36.202 --> 01:18:39.002
Tamitza Shachar, Tavishon, Arvayim,

cue0020685
01:18:39.002 --> 01:18:45.882
But the love that is not based on them is Zeman, because they have nothing to do with the work of Zara.

cue0020686
01:18:45.882 --> 01:18:52.022
The work of Zara is not to build, to wait, to build a Temple.

cue0020687
01:18:52.022 --> 01:18:58.522
Even in pre-Bitamina 2, the word didn't bring any

cue0020688
