Qorban Sabur that is not based on Zeman.

cue0020689
01:19:02.702 --> 01:19:05.362
This is very, all those things are very profound.

cue0020690
01:19:05.362 --> 01:19:28.082
Unfortunately, I cannot go now into the subject, but this more or less, this mahluket, the point is, but the question is about Bet HaMikdash.

cue0020691
01:19:28.082 --> 01:19:41.082
With the Bet HaMikdash, you see, Vama Gerla, it was not Bet HaMikdash. It was a public altar. But what was it missing?

cue0020692
01:19:41.082 --> 01:19:51.082
According to Rabbi Shimon, the fact that we did not have a place kabua. That's the point. The difference between Vama and Gerla and Bet HaMikdash is the question of Nahala.

cue0020693
01:19:51.082 --> 01:19:54.582
Nahala, we're going to see it in the following suga.

cue0020694
01:19:54.582 --> 01:19:59.982
Since it's not Nahala, in other words, there's no perpetuity in the place.

cue0020695
01:20:00.000 --> 01:20:14.000
If there is no date, you cannot bring it there. You see something very interesting about the relationship between time and space.

cue0020696
