I doubt it. But it has to do with, strange enough, political philosophy of Judaism. And we see how, and of course there's maḥloqet, Rambam, and there is Shanim, and there is, let me begin with Mishna.

cue0020706
01:21:59.580 --> 01:22:04.460
And Ben Shiloh L'Yerushalayim. Now we're comparing Yerushalayim with Yerushalayim.

cue0020707
01:22:04.460 --> 01:22:12.620
Before Bamak Yedola, Bamak Yitana, which means pre-Bet Hamikdash, and now is Shiloh.

cue0020708
01:22:12.620 --> 01:22:21.900
Shiloh is the last place where the Mishkan of Moshe was prior to the building of the Bet Hamikdash in Yerushalayim.

cue0020709
01:22:21.900 --> 01:22:46.034
So what the first Avinci Law is of course obviously the Bama Gidola the last great Bama Gidola we had And says Hashem you know Chalashim Qalim Maasei Sheni Bechol Haroe Now Chalashim Qalim and Maasei Sheni you could eat it in Yerushalayim

cue0020710
01:22:46.034 --> 01:23:00.034
I mean, you make the, of course you bring the Qorban in the Bet hammiqdash, but you eat it, I mean, Baalim, ochlim otam, ochlim de, nefayashim qalim, ve'maseh shini, Birushalayim.

cue0020711
01:23:00.034 --> 01:23:03.034
So, what's the difference?

cue0020712
01:23:03.034 --> 01:23:11.034
In Shiloh is Bechol HaRoeh. As long as you could see the Mishkanim Shiloh, all same thing.

cue0020713
01:23:11.034 --> 01:23:20.034
So, if you could see from the Mishkan Shiloh, they could see you, which is the same thing. Maybe not, I don't know, I mean about geography, maybe the places is low or high.

cue0020714
01:23:20.034 --> 01:23:31.034
So, but I think the Yerushalmi says that if you could see the person standing in the Shiloh, or you know, from where you are, that's good enough and vice versa.

cue0020715
01:23:31.034 --> 01:23:36.034
The people in Shiloh, they could see you, it's good enough. So, probably it's not identical, you know.

cue0020716
01:23:36.034 --> 01:23:49.034
You know, so therefore, Tchol HaRoe means whether there are advantages of one direction or the other, because maybe one is an attitude and the other is no attitude, so anyhow.

cue0020717
01:23:49.034 --> 01:23:55.034
So Tchol HaRoe means makes a difference which direction, alright? So now, Tchol HaRoe.

cue0020718
