But Yerushalayim, Lefnim Minah Homa. Now, Lefnim Minah Homa is very important here, because it means that the Kedusha of Yerushalayim, it has a boundary.

cue0020719
01:24:04.834 --> 01:24:16.634
It means it has a geographical boundary. The boundary is the Homo. And outside the Homa of Yerushalayim, there is no Kedusha of Yerushalayim.

cue0020720
